# Force LF line endings for text files on checkout, regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks these files out as
# CRLF, which Prettier's default endOfLine:"lf" then flags as a formatting violation - exactly
# what broke `npm run check`'s format:check locally during the C5.6 gate (2026-09-05), even though
# the committed content itself was already LF and CI (Linux runners) never sees this.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
